                  "declaration": "useCartTotals",
                  "reading": "The author added a function `useCartTotals()` that returns `{ itemCount, totalCents }`, two numbers read from the cart store. `itemCount` is the result of [`selectItemCount()`](code:src/stores/cart-store.ts#L24-26), which adds the `quantity` of every item. `totalCents` is the result of [`selectTotalCents()`](code:src/stores/cart-store.ts#L28-30), which adds `priceCents * quantity` of every item. [`<CartPage />` calls it](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L9) and [renders the two numbers in its `<h1>`](code:src/routes/cart/index.tsx#L13-15), so that the page gets both values of the heading from one call. No other file imports it.",
